v>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$90</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Saw Distance\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Saw Distance</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15 Studs</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Loop Range\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Loop Range</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Pre-release</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Rusty Saw</b> is the saw that players start with when creating a fresh save. It's the worst saw in the game, being also sold on the shelf by the entrance of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a> for $90.\n</p><p>Saws are tools used to cut off the bark of trees, increasing their price. Essentially, <b>Rusty Saw</b> is a worse handheld version of <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Sander\" title=\"Rusty Sander\">Rusty Sander</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Rusty Saw</b>, like the name implies, is a typical looking saw with noticeable signs of corrosion present on it's blade. It's handle is made out of the same wood other rusty tools use for their handles. \n</p><p>Blade is gray in color with the default legacy rust material applied to it. Handle is using a brown yellowish coloring, having the default legacy wood material applied.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Initially, player started off with a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a> and a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Putter\" title=\"Rusty Putter\">Rusty Putter</a>. Only after the 1.27.0 update, new players would start with a set of a <a href=\"/wiki/Rusty_Axe\" title=\"Rusty Axe\">Rusty Axe</a> and a <b>Rusty Saw</b></li>\n<li>In early pre-release, players could buy a <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Saw\" title=\"Wooden Saw\">Wooden Saw</a>, alongside other \"starter\" tools. These being: <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Chisel\" title=\"Wooden Chisel\">Wooden Chisel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stone_Pickaxe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stone Pickaxe\">Stone Pickaxe</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Wooden_Axe\" title=\"Wooden Axe\">Wooden Axe</a>. Only the latter would ever see the release.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163550\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 78/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 47/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 11/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019497/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   35.126      1 Template:Saw\n100.00%   35.126      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:294-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163550 and revision id 10353. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Tools","Saws"],"links":[{"title":"Rusty Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Putter","exists":true},{"title":"Rusty Sander","exists":true},{"title":"Stone Pickaxe","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Axe","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Chisel","exists":true},{"title":"Wooden Saw","exists":true}],"images":["Rusty_Saw.png","Rusty_Saw_Boxed.png"]}
